+# Everything Server - Project Structure
+**[Architecture](architecture.md)
+| Project Structure
+| [Startup Process](startup.md)
+| [Server Features](features.md)
+| [Extension Points](extension.md)
+| [How It Works](how-it-works.md)**
+
+```
+src/everything
+     ├── index.ts
